#: admin/class-mcp-admin-activity.php:52
msgid ""
"Every change an agent makes is journaled with its before-state. Undo a "
"single change, or roll the whole database back to a checkpoint."
msgstr ""
"代理所做的每项更改都会连同更改前的状态记入日志。您可以撤销单项更改，也可以将"
"整个数据库回滚到某个检查点。"

